        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;position:relative;color:#fff8f3;font-family:system-ui;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 53% 12%,#c47e9e 0%,#743d5b 44%,#2f1b34 100%)\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:3cqw;top:3cqw;font:800 1.7cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#ffe6d5\">THE LITTLE DESIGN STUDIO</div><div style=\"position:absolute;right:3cqw;top:3cqw;font:700 1.8cqw system-ui;color:#f8dbda\">✦ VINYL &amp; STENCILS ✦</div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11%;right:11%;top:15%;bottom:14%;background:#f9e4e5;border:1cqw solid #ecb4c5;box-shadow:0 1cqw 7cqw #20101caa,inset 0 0 0 .5cqw #fff3e9\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5%;right:5%;top:6%;height:20%;background:#6b354e;border-radius:1.5cqw;display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:0 0 1.5cqw #f5bfc7\"><span style=\"font:600 7.7cqw/1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.055em;color:#fff7ef\">Blusheree <span style=\"color:#ffbed3\">♡</span></span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:8%;right:8%;top:34%;bottom:6%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:5%\"><div style=\"border:.5cqw solid #d3a0b7;background:#fff9f5;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative\"><span style=\"font:600 8cqw Georgia,serif;color:#b96589;transform:rotate(-8deg)\">hello</span><span style=\"position:absolute;bottom:8%;font:800 1.5cqw system-ui;color:#95637e\">DECALS</span></div><div style=\"border:.5cqw solid #d3a0b7;background:#fcebee;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative\"><span style=\"font:600 13cqw Georgia,serif;color:#a9547a\">✿</span><span style=\"position:absolute;bottom:8%;font:800 1.5cqw system-ui;color:#95637e\">STENCILS</span></div><div style=\"border:.5cqw solid #d3a0b7;background:#fff9f5;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative\"><span style=\"font:600 7cqw Georgia,serif;color:#b96589\">♡</span><span style=\"position:absolute;bottom:8%;font:800 1.5cqw system-ui;color:#95637e\">YOUR DESIGN</span></div></div></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:15%;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#40263d 0 7cqw,#482c45 7cqw 7.2cqw);border-top:1cqw solid #d3a0b7\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:4%;left:5%;font:600 2cqw Georgia,serif;color:#ffe7cd\">A little sweet. A lot of personality.</div><div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:4%;right:5%;font:700 1.8cqw system-ui;color:#ffd6da\">HANDMADE FEEL ♡</div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "Blusheree showroom concept. Illustrative examples, not product photographs."
      }
