          "nodeId": "12569386-1951-4f65-8a0d-51e09eb5414d"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff8f3,#f8e1e7);border:1px solid #d8aabb;border-radius:3cqw;color:#4d2b40;padding:6cqw;font-family:system-ui\"><div style=\"font:800 2.9cqw system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#9c5878\">A NOTE FOR THE OWNER</div><h2 style=\"font:600 8.3cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:3.5cqw 0 3cqw\">The finishing touches</h2><p style=\"font:400 4.15cqw/1.48 system-ui;margin:0;color:#67485a\">Replace the concept samples with photos of your actual decals and stencils. Add your preferred contact method, sizes, materials, ordering process and a favorite design.</p><div style=\"margin-top:5cqw;padding-top:4cqw;border-top:1px solid #dfb6c4;font:600 3.3cqw/1.5 system-ui;color:#a26786\">Everything here is editable. Make it unmistakably Blusheree ♡</div></div>"
        },
        "sourceMarkdown": "# To personalize\n\n- Actual product photographs\n- Contact and ordering information\n- Sizes, materials, colors\n- Favorite designs and logo\n- Any available pricing or turnaround details",
